WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:02.034
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.034 --> 00:00:03.136
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.136 --> 00:00:04.437
We hope you're all
doing well tonight.

00:00:04.437 --> 00:00:06.238
And if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:06.238 --> 00:00:08.908
President Biden returned
to the White House today

00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:10.609
after Queen Elizabeth's funeral.

00:00:10.609 --> 00:00:13.146
Of course,
now he's calling it his flat.

00:00:13.146 --> 00:00:18.151
[ Laughter ]

00:00:18.151 --> 00:00:20.753
According to a new survey,
80% of Americans said

00:00:20.753 --> 00:00:23.889
that they have not cried about
the death of Queen Elizabeth,

00:00:23.889 --> 00:00:27.460
while the other 20%
said, "No spoilers!"

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:30.396
[ Laughter ]

00:00:30.396 --> 00:00:32.365
President Biden appeared
for an interview

00:00:32.365 --> 00:00:34.267
on last night's episode
of "60 Minutes,"

00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:37.303
or as it was known yesterday,
"600 Minutes."

00:00:37.303 --> 00:00:38.771
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.771 --> 00:00:42.075
"I ever tell you about the time
I almost met Warren G. Harding?"

00:00:42.075 --> 00:00:43.843
[ Laughter ]

00:00:43.843 --> 00:00:45.278
According to new poll,
President Biden's

00:00:45.278 --> 00:00:47.313
approval rating has hit
an 11-month high.

00:00:47.313 --> 00:00:50.250
Wow! Inflation really is
out of control.

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:52.218
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.218 --> 00:00:54.687
Attorney General Merrick Garland
administered

00:00:54.687 --> 00:00:56.389
the oath of allegiance
on Saturday

00:00:56.389 --> 00:00:59.992
to 200 new U.S. citizens
during a naturalization ceremony

00:00:59.992 --> 00:01:03.596
on Ellis Island and said,
"We must not allow the fractures

00:01:03.596 --> 00:01:06.332
between us
to fracture our democracy,"

00:01:06.332 --> 00:01:09.035
which must have been alarming
for the new citizens.

00:01:09.035 --> 00:01:12.372
"Congratulations!
Enjoy it while it lasts."

00:01:12.372 --> 00:01:14.307
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.307 --> 00:01:16.843
After Florida governor
Ron DeSantis sent two planes

00:01:16.843 --> 00:01:18.644
of migrants to Martha's Vineyard
last week,

00:01:18.644 --> 00:01:21.714
Texas governor Greg Abbott
bused dozens of migrants

00:01:21.714 --> 00:01:24.550
to Vice President Kamala Harris'
residence in Washington, D.C.

00:01:24.550 --> 00:01:26.519
Okay. What's going on
with these governors?

00:01:26.519 --> 00:01:29.289
It's like we radicalized
the Impractical Jokers.

00:01:29.289 --> 00:01:30.622
[ Laughter ]

00:01:30.622 --> 00:01:33.159
"Okay, now go up to him
and give him a bus ticket."

00:01:33.159 --> 00:01:36.296
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.296 --> 00:01:38.164
In his speech in Ohio
over the weekend,

00:01:38.164 --> 00:01:40.333
former president Trump said
that he had a

00:01:40.333 --> 00:01:42.468
"very luxurious
and enjoyable life"

00:01:42.468 --> 00:01:43.903
before he entered politics.

00:01:43.903 --> 00:01:46.172
Dude, you didn't enter politics.

00:01:46.172 --> 00:01:49.409
You went straight to president
without even trying.

00:01:49.409 --> 00:01:52.845
Don't make it sound like you
gave up your medical practice

00:01:52.845 --> 00:01:56.515
to go door-to-door, campaigning
for city comptroller.

00:01:56.515 --> 00:01:58.151
You had a nice house,

00:01:58.151 --> 00:02:01.087
and then, for a while,
you had two nice houses.

00:02:01.087 --> 00:02:02.822
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.822 --> 00:02:05.291
Two radio hosts in New Jersey
are facing criticism

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:07.527
after voicing support
for teachers

00:02:07.527 --> 00:02:09.629
who have been accused of
having sex with students.

00:02:09.629 --> 00:02:13.032
For what it's worth, the radio
hosts have issued an apology

00:02:13.032 --> 00:02:15.868
and a genuinely remorseful
sound effect.

00:02:15.868 --> 00:02:17.337
[ Sad trombone ]

00:02:17.337 --> 00:02:24.243
[ Laughter ]

00:02:24.243 --> 00:02:26.813
Kanye West announced last week
that he has terminated

00:02:26.813 --> 00:02:29.082
his partnership with
the clothing company Gap.

00:02:29.082 --> 00:02:32.185
Instead, he's going
with Ann Taylor Loft.

00:02:32.185 --> 00:02:37.690
[ Laughter ]

00:02:37.690 --> 00:02:39.458
And, finally,
producers have announced

00:02:39.458 --> 00:02:41.628
that "Phantom of the Opera,"
which is the longest-running

00:02:41.628 --> 00:02:43.563
Broadway show,
will close next year.

00:02:43.563 --> 00:02:47.567
Said one man, "Oh, sure, right
when masks become optional."

00:02:47.567 --> 00:02:49.702
[ Laughter ]

00:02:49.702 --> 00:02:51.471
"I was gonna leave it on!"

00:02:51.471 --> 00:02:53.005
[ Laughter ]

00:02:53.005 --> 00:02:54.607
That was the monologue,
everybody!

